<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97564" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαθαιρέω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put down together, join in putting down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν βάρβαρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.132
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐκείνων δύναμιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς κρατοῦντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.46
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>take down with</i> others, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκείνην
				τοῖς ὑπηρέταις συγκαθεῖλε</span>
			<i>with</i> their <i>help took down</i> her body, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Agis</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σορτίον ς</span>. <i>help to
				take</i> it <i>off</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνανατιθέναι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>VP</u>
				42
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>win with</i> any one, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέντε σφι ἀγῶνας
				τοὺς μεγίστους ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.35
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
